# Apple Siri / Search — bind this RULE-SET to the SAME non-mainland proxy
# policy group as Apple-AI.list (e.g. a dedicated 🍎 Siri group). Matchers only.
# No policy / proxy-group names.
#
# Operational note (owner iPhone real-device test; NOT an Apple region mandate):
#   Networked Siri queries worked only when this set and Apple-AI.list shared the
#   same non-mainland-China proxy exit. A Taiwan node worked; DIRECT failed;
#   at least one US node also failed (possibly node-specific). Verify the exit
#   that works on your device — Apple does not document a required egress region.
#
# Official reachability (purpose / MitM guidance only — NOT routing policy):
#   https://support.apple.com/en-us/101555  § Apple Intelligence, Siri, and Search
#   - guzzoni.apple.com — Siri and dictation requests (Supports proxies: —)
#   - *.smoot.apple.com — Search services including Siri/Spotlight/Lookup/… (Supports proxies: —)
# Official docs require access without HTTPS interception; they do not mandate
# DIRECT vs proxy, and they do not prescribe any country/region for egress.
#
# Contrast: some maintained “unlock” lists (e.g. ruleset.isteed.cc AppleIntelligence.conf,
# RocM301/Apple-Rule) place guzzoni/smoot in the same proxy set as PCC. This repo
# keeps a separate Siri list so it can share one verified exit with Apple-AI without
# merging unrelated OpenAI/catch-all traffic into the same file.
#
# --- Official (101555) — Siri / Search hosts ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,guzzoni.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com
#
# --- Community Siri-associated (NOT listed in Apple 101555 AI/Siri table) ---
# UNCERTAIN routing strength: documented/community purpose ≠ required egress region.
# Fetched community labels (purpose claims only):
#   https://www.netify.ai/resources/hostnames/siri.apple.com  → Apple Siri
#   https://www.netify.ai/resources/hostnames/dejavu.apple.com → Apple Siri
#   https://www.netify.ai/resources/hostnames/sequoia.apple.com → Apple Siri
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Thoseyearsbrian/Aegis/main/rules/Apple.list
#       → sequoia.apple.com labeled “翻译服务接口”; siri.apple.com labeled Siri
# Kept narrow (no DOMAIN-KEYWORD,siri) to avoid shadowing unrelated Apple traffic.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,siri.apple.com
DOMAIN,api-siri-prod.apple.com
DOMAIN,dejavu.apple.com
# UNCERTAIN: sequoia.apple.com — Netify: Siri; Aegis: translation. Included narrowly.
DOMAIN,sequoia.apple.com
